# Response headers of an election's bundles, its map and its data, which
# `ems build` writes to dist/map/<slug>/_headers and dist/data/<slug>/_headers
# (src/election_map_slovakia/bundle.py), for the Cloudflare Pages project
# of each bundle (docs/deploy.md). Syntax and limits as in web/_headers.

# The app on the site's own domain fetches the files from here, so every
# origin may read them: they are public data. Search engines should index
# the site, not its data files.
#
# The app names the bundle by the address of the deployment that carries
# its key, which never serves other files, and asks for every file with
# ?v=<the bundle's version> (served locally by `ems serve`, the same path
# serves each new build): a copy is good for ever.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
